  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><b>Cost</b></td>\n<td>$500, 500x <a href=\"/index.php/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">steel</a>, 10,000x <a href=\"/index.php/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">wood</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Total Cost</b></td>\n<td>$6,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Inputs</b></td>\n<td>110x <a href=\"/index.php/Crude_oil\" title=\"Crude oil\">crude oil</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Outputs</b></td>\n<td>14x <a href=\"/index.php/Polyester\" title=\"Polyester\">polyester</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production interval</b></td>\n<td>25 seconds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production/Min</b></td>\n<td>33.6x <a href=\"/index.php/Polyester\" title=\"Polyester\">polyester</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Min</b></td>\n<td>$67.20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Hour</b></td>\n<td>$4,032.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Return On Investment</b></td>\n<td>0.68%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Aliases</b></td>\n<td>polyester factory, polyesterfactory,<br /> polyester fac\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The polyester factory is a facility that produces 14x <a href=\"/index.php/Polyester\" title=\"Polyester\">polyester</a> every 25 seconds.\n</p><p>It takes up the production of 22/5x <a href=\"/index.php/Oil_well\" title=\"Oil well\">Oil wells</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_facilities\">Related facilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Polyester_factory&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Related facilities\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><b>As input</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Clothing_factory\" title=\"Clothing factory\">Clothing factory</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009091853\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage